        "subject": "LU-20292 build: improve kernel rpm naming for RHEL",
        "message": "LU-20292 build: improve kernel rpm naming for RHEL\n\nImprove Lustre kernel rpm naming for RHEL to include the same version\nas the baseline kernel.\nOn RHEL 9 and 10, rely on the kabiversion contained in the kernel\nspec file, and on RHEL 8 use the pkgrelease. This is necessary in\norder to get the full kernel version that includes the distro variant\nlike .el8_10 for RHEL 8.10.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Sebastien Buisson <sbuisson@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: Ic1cb5f9babc6d169da720473047a177a8db2d301\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66065\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Shaun Tancheff <shaun.tancheff@hpe.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Jian Yu <yujian@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
